# Top-down sofa (issue 047, from the sofa photos): oak back rail and oak arms, a kilim-pattern back cushion, two seat cushions with a seam between, oak front rail and legs. 6x2 tiles. 034 notes: the poses replace one or two 16-wide columns of this.
size: 96x32
